title: "FisherWright.jl"
abstract: >-
  Forward-time Wright–Fisher simulation of whole-genome sequence founder
  populations in Julia: diploid individuals, infinite-sites mutation,
  crossover recombination, changing population size, non-random mating
  schemes and selection on fitness loci or traits.
